@baseUrl = http://localhost:1198
@token = paste-access-token-from-login-response-here

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login - missing fields (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Login - wrong creds (should 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### Login - correct (copy accessToken from response and paste into @token above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Protected - /me without token (should 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### Protected - /me with token (should 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
